  "href": "utility/utility_utility_representation.html",
  "body_html": "<h1>Utility Representation</h1>\n<p>A utility function $u$ represents a preference relation if it preserves and\nreflects weak preference:\n$$\n  x \\le y \\quad\\text{if and only if}\\quad u(x)\\le u(y).\n$$</p>\n<p>Consequently, the same utility representation also preserves strict preference\nand indifference.</p>",
